  "term": "tetrabenazine",
  "definition": "Tetrabenazine is a drug that was formerly used as an antipsychotic and to treat several movement disorders. It works by blocking the uptake of neurotransmitters into adrenergic storage vesicles and has also been used as a high-affinity marker for the vesicle transport system.",
